  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Extraordinary Earth update: April 10th, 2091


    As of today, April
    10th of the year 2091, humanity has made contact with the first advanced extraterrestrial
    civilization.


    We have been visited by a red probe with an impressively
    sophisticated design. While our scientists try to decipher what information it
    might carry, all planet Earth eagerly awaits the return of the remaining crew
    members of Pinta IV.


    It is without a doubt thanks to your expeditions through
    the stars that we have finally been noticed, and it is a pleasure to declare
    the mission of project STARS as a success.


    The whole world owes our future
    as an intergalactic species to you.


    Well done, and see you soon.


    STARS'
