  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Monthly Earth update: April 5th, 2091


    Team 7 has returned home safely,
    and we are eagerly awaiting the arrival of teams 8 and 9 by the end of the month.

    That
    only leaves team 10, which has had the duration of their mission extended due
    to the circumstances you all know.

    We have been given approval to continue
    even with a single crew member, as the results from this expedition are of utmost
    importance.

    From everyone here on Earth, we wish you the best of luck in
    the remainder of your journey.


    Now for the news:


    The construction
    of Pinta V is nearly done, and the second wave of astronauts has already been
    selected. We expect to launch the next expedition a year from now. We hope you
    can share your experiences with the new crew members to help them on their mission.


    Also,
    as we mentioned before, while you won''t be taking part of Pinta V''s journey,
    we have a whole year of aptitude tests ahead to select the third wave of astronauts.
    All of you have priority in case you wish to carry out another expedition.


    Finally,
    we have extremely exciting news to share with you. You will have to wait a few
    more days, however, as an official statement is being made right now. We can''t
    wait to tell you all about it.


    May the stars guide you to our future.


    STARS'
